---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Banco Aluminium"
  description="Privacy policy for Banco Aluminium Private Limited. How we collect, use, and protect personal data submitted through bancoaluminium.com."
>
  <section style="background:var(--color-navy);padding-top:148px;padding-bottom:72px">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow on-dark">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="t-h1" style="color:var(--color-platinum);margin-top:20px;max-width:22ch">
        Privacy policy.
      </h1>
      <p class="t-lead" style="color:var(--color-silver);margin-top:20px;max-width:56ch">
        Banco Aluminium Private Limited · Last updated: January 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-light section-pad">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prv-grid">
        <aside class="prv-toc">
          <div class="prv-toc-label">Contents</div>
          <nav>
            <a href="#collection">1. Data we collect</a>
            <a href="#use">2. How we use it</a>
            <a href="#storage">3. Storage & security</a>
            <a href="#third-parties">4. Third parties</a>
            <a href="#rights">5. Your rights</a>
            <a href="#contact">6. Contact</a>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <article class="prv-body">

          <section id="collection" class="prv-section">
            <h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
            <p>When you use the contact or quote request forms on bancoaluminium.com, we collect the personal data you voluntarily submit — including your name, email address, phone number, company name, and any technical information included in your message or file uploads.</p>
            <p>We may also collect standard web server log data (IP address, browser type, pages visited, time and date) through our hosting infrastructure. This data is not linked to individual identities.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="use" class="prv-section">
            <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
            <p>We use the data you submit exclusively to respond to your enquiry, process quotation requests, and communicate with you about the products and services you have asked about. We do not use your data for marketing purposes without your explicit consent, and we do not sell or rent your data to any third party.</p>
            <p>Careers applications submitted through our website are used solely for recruitment purposes within Banco Aluminium Private Limited.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="storage" class="prv-section">
            <h2>3. Storage &amp; security</h2>
            <p>Data submitted through contact forms is processed and stored on servers operated by our hosting and form-processing providers. We retain enquiry data for as long as necessary to manage the business relationship, typically not exceeding 3 years from last contact.</p>
            <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect data against unauthorised access, loss, or disclosure. No internet transmission is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="third-parties" class="prv-section">
            <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
            <p>Our website may use third-party services including Google Fonts (typography), analytics, and form processing tools. These services may collect usage data subject to their own privacy policies. We do not embed social media tracking pixels or advertising networks on this site.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="rights" class="prv-section">
            <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
            <p>You have the right to request access to personal data we hold about you, to request correction of inaccurate data, and to request deletion of your data where we have no legitimate reason to retain it. To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact" class="prv-section">
            <h2>6. Contact</h2>
            <p>For privacy-related enquiries, contact Banco Aluminium Private Limited at:</p>
            <div class="prv-address">
              <div>Banco Aluminium Private Limited</div>
              <div>Vadodara, Gujarat, India</div>
              <div><a href="/contact">Contact form</a></div>
            </div>
          </section>

        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .prv-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 100px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .prv-toc {
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
  }
  .prv-toc-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-green);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .prv-toc nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .prv-toc a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-stone-400);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200);
  }
  .prv-toc a:hover { color: var(--color-navy); border-left-color: var(--color-green); }

  .prv-section {
    padding-top: 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200);
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .prv-section:first-child { margin-top: 0; padding-top: 0; border-top: none; }
  .prv-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .prv-section p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-stone-700);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .prv-address {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-stone-700);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-200);
    background: var(--color-stone-50);
  }
  .prv-address a { color: var(--color-green); text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .prv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .prv-toc { position: static; display: none; }
  }
</style>
